---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base path="/schedule" title="Book a Consultation | Anthem Music McKinney" description="Book a free consultation with an Anthem Music instructor in downtown McKinney. Pick your instrument and see open times.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center;">Book a Consultation</span>
      <h1 class="center">Let's find the right fit</h1>
      <p class="lead mx-auto center">Every new student starts with a consultation - a relaxed, no-pressure visit to meet an instructor, see the studio, ask questions, and figure out the right instrument, program, and schedule together. Booking below reserves that visit; it doesn't enroll you in a class or start weekly lessons yet.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:1rem;">
    <div class="container widget-wrap">
      <div class="howto">
        <h2>How booking works</h2>
        <p>Most programs, lessons, and classes at Anthem start with a worry-free consultation.</p>
        <p><strong>Not sure where to start?</strong> Choose <strong>Consultation</strong>. On the next screen you can pick the instructor, instrument, or program that best fits your needs - tap <em>Show More</em> to see everything we offer.</p>
        <p><strong>Already know the class or program you're interested in?</strong> Choose it below to see the instructors who match, then pick a consultation time that fits your schedule.</p>
        <p class="howto-note">Selecting a class, program, or lesson here - PreK, Youth Group, Guitar, and so on - doesn't enroll you. It simply books a consultation so we can find the best fit for you or your child together. Ready to jump straight into a class instead? <a href="/book-a-class">See class times &amp; open seats →</a> - your first class is free.</p>
      </div>
      <div id="mms-booking">
        <script is:inline src="https://app.mymusicstaff.com/Widget/v4/Widget.ashx?settings=eyJTY2hvb2xJRCI6InNjaF9Qc3RKNCIsIldlYnNpdGVJRCI6Indic190SnJKRyIsIldlYnNpdGVCbG9ja0lEIjoid2JiX3p3MEpiSjUifQ=="></script>
      </div>
      <p class="widget-help center">Questions before booking? Call or text us at <a href="tel:+14695009863">(469) 500-9863</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-hero { background: var(--cream-soft); padding: clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem) 0 2rem; }
  .page-hero h1 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .widget-wrap { max-width: 1040px; }
  /* Wider wrap + slimmer padding gives the MMS widget more room, which helps
     the instrument list ("5. Violin") render without truncating. */
  #mms-booking { background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1rem; min-height: 400px; }
  .widget-help { margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .widget-help a { color: var(--orange); font-weight: 500; }
  .howto { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 1.6rem; background: var(--cream-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.5rem 1.8rem; }
  .howto h2 { color: var(--navy); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
  .howto p { color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.96rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .howto p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .howto p strong { color: var(--navy); }
  .howto p em { font-style: italic; }
  .howto-note { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 0.85rem; }
  .class-crosslink { margin-top: 1.4rem; }
  .class-crosslink p { color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .class-crosslink a { color: var(--orange); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
